WEBVTT

00:14.800 --> 00:15.720
BUILDING 5

00:15.800 --> 00:19.970
Our next opponent: Team W.

00:20.060 --> 00:22.350
They've lost once to Team V,

00:23.060 --> 00:26.020
so like us, they're at the "lose and you're out" stage.

00:26.110 --> 00:30.570
But they beat Barou's Team X 4-1, the same team we lost to.

00:31.530 --> 00:33.780
We can assume they're better than us.

00:33.860 --> 00:36.780
After all, we're Team Z.

00:36.870 --> 00:39.040
What kind of playing style do they have?

00:41.540 --> 00:44.460
Anyway, one thing we do know:

00:45.040 --> 00:47.350
Team W's key players are these two,

00:48.290 --> 00:49.710
the Wanima brothers.

02:31.650 --> 02:34.480
These twins are good at combination play.

02:35.230 --> 02:37.820
When they beat Team X,

02:37.900 --> 02:40.110
these two scored four goals.

02:40.700 --> 02:43.740
The distance between them, the timing of their movements,

02:43.830 --> 02:44.830
and their give-and-goes

02:44.910 --> 02:48.410
are powerful weapons we can't easily stop, even if we know about them.

02:48.500 --> 02:51.710
But when they're isolated, they can't use this weapon.

02:51.790 --> 02:54.340
Right, that's why we're going to separate them.

02:54.420 --> 02:56.960
That's the key to beating Team W.

02:57.050 --> 02:59.970
Anyway, why is Iemon leading the meeting?

03:00.050 --> 03:01.930
Wasn't Kuon handling this stuff?

03:02.600 --> 03:05.760
Yeah, but Kuon still hasn't come back from the shower.

03:05.850 --> 03:07.140
Can't I do it?

03:07.220 --> 03:11.100
Of course! And we've got our plan ready to beat them.

03:11.180 --> 03:12.600
Right, Gagamaru—

03:12.680 --> 03:14.730
-That hurt!
-Hasn't he been in the shower too long?

03:14.770 --> 03:16.580
-Don't mess with me.
-Maybe he's dead.

03:16.650 --> 03:17.780
I will mess with you!

03:19.320 --> 03:21.610
Welcome back, coach.

03:22.280 --> 03:24.200
Sorry, kept you waiting.

03:24.280 --> 03:26.160
He's alive.

03:26.240 --> 03:28.910
I was thinking about a plan for tomorrow's match

03:29.000 --> 03:30.000
and got lost in thought.

03:31.460 --> 03:33.080
What did you guys do?

03:33.170 --> 03:35.710
We were just analyzing things on screen.

03:35.790 --> 03:36.670
I see.

03:36.750 --> 03:38.210
You seriously look like a corpse!

03:38.300 --> 03:41.760
Don't die on us, we'd only have 10 players.

03:41.840 --> 03:43.640
We can't win like that!

03:49.180 --> 03:50.520
In the next match,

03:50.600 --> 03:53.350
we'll use what we gained from the previous game.

03:54.020 --> 03:55.610
<i>The "Next 9 is Me" plan</i>

03:55.690 --> 03:57.900
<i>limited our weapons to 10 minutes,</i>

03:57.980 --> 03:59.030
<i>disrupted our rhythm,</i>

03:59.110 --> 04:01.820
<i>and made us waste time on ineffective weapons.</i>

04:01.900 --> 04:03.320
<i>So this time,</i>

04:03.990 --> 04:07.080
<i>we'll use 3 spearheads with compatible weapons</i>

04:07.160 --> 04:11.040
<i>and apply 3 different formations for 30 minutes each.</i>

04:11.120 --> 04:13.750
This is our new plan, with three groups of three,

04:13.830 --> 04:16.340
where everyone will shine.

04:16.420 --> 04:17.670
It's called

04:17.750 --> 04:20.050
the "Stars of the South Plan!"

04:20.130 --> 04:22.880
That's crap. You racked your brain and came up with that?

04:22.970 --> 04:24.760
You suck at naming things!

04:27.050 --> 04:32.060
I like it. I like southerners. Like "Erotic Seven."

04:32.140 --> 04:34.520
Gagamaru! You get me, don't you?

04:34.600 --> 04:38.270
More importantly, am I going to be stuck in goal forever?

04:38.360 --> 04:40.900
Can't be helped—we won, after all!

04:40.990 --> 04:42.990
What are you saying at this point?

04:43.070 --> 04:44.950
I'm grateful.

04:45.030 --> 04:45.950
Just wanted to say.

04:46.030 --> 04:48.280
Isagi, thanks.

04:48.370 --> 04:51.200
Are you happy staying in defense all the time, Chigiri?

04:52.040 --> 04:54.160
If you've got time to worry about someone else,

04:54.250 --> 04:56.420
think about how you're going to score.

04:57.000 --> 04:58.040
Sorry.

05:03.380 --> 05:04.300
Alright!

05:04.380 --> 05:07.680
We've scouted the opponent and we've come together as a team!

05:07.760 --> 05:09.850
This match is ours, Team Z!

05:09.930 --> 05:11.140
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

05:12.270 --> 05:15.190
<i>He's right. If we lose, it's all over.</i>

05:15.270 --> 05:17.020
<i>We'll win! Definitely!</i>

05:19.190 --> 05:21.320
BUILDING 5

05:22.030 --> 05:26.280
MATCH 7

05:40.250 --> 05:41.750
We're diving in, bro!

05:41.840 --> 05:43.090
When do you want the pass?

05:43.170 --> 05:44.920
What kind of pass do you want?

05:45.010 --> 05:46.050
Tell us!

05:46.550 --> 05:48.390
Hm! I get it!

05:48.470 --> 05:50.390
Uga buga!

05:50.470 --> 05:53.220
"Right now I want a pass to my feet,"

05:53.310 --> 05:54.850
my big bro says!

05:57.390 --> 05:58.810
Amen!

05:58.900 --> 06:00.440
-"Kill two birds with one stone."
-What?

06:00.520 --> 06:02.610
That's what bro says.

06:03.280 --> 06:05.940
What the hell are these guys? Someone stop them!

06:06.820 --> 06:08.280
<i>First 30 minutes,</i>

06:08.360 --> 06:10.410
<i>I'm at right-midfield.</i>

06:10.490 --> 06:12.200
<i>My task is clear.</i>

06:12.280 --> 06:13.710
<i>First, we all need to separate those two</i>

06:14.070 --> 06:15.470
<i>from each other.</i>

06:18.900 --> 06:20.490
<i>We're not stopping them at all!</i>

06:20.540 --> 06:22.340
<i>Even though we know their playing style.</i>

06:22.420 --> 06:25.130
"Our weapon is eye contact."

06:25.210 --> 06:28.680
"Don't think you can stop us with a shoddy defense!"

06:28.760 --> 06:30.720
That's what my bro is pondering deeply.

06:30.800 --> 06:32.050
They're coming, Chigiri!

06:32.140 --> 06:33.010
We'll stop them!

06:33.100 --> 06:34.350
"Chigiri?"

06:35.020 --> 06:36.180
By Chigiri, do you mean

06:36.270 --> 06:38.480
that glass genius?

06:41.060 --> 06:44.650
Look, bro, he's still playing soccer!

06:44.730 --> 06:48.200
Like he can't forget his past achievements!

06:49.070 --> 06:50.660
Heh heh, exactly!

06:50.740 --> 06:53.490
"As an old teammate, I can say"

06:55.870 --> 06:58.750
"your career is already over!"

06:59.410 --> 07:01.460
So says my bro.

07:03.250 --> 07:05.210
Are you sure about that?

07:05.300 --> 07:09.010
If you run, your glass leg might break again!

07:16.270 --> 07:17.600
"You kidding me!"

07:17.680 --> 07:20.480
"That's definitely a foul, VAR-san!"

07:20.560 --> 07:22.060
my bro says angrily!

07:22.150 --> 07:25.230
We know it's a foul, you chatterbox brothers!

07:25.310 --> 07:27.410
But since play hasn't stopped, it's not a foul!

07:27.430 --> 07:28.530
Nice pass, Isagi!

07:28.610 --> 07:32.030
Don't listen to those parasites, Chigiri!

07:32.660 --> 07:34.950
Forget about the past.

07:35.030 --> 07:38.120
To me, you're Chigiri Hyoma of Team Z!

07:39.040 --> 07:41.080
Shut up, optimist.

07:41.170 --> 07:42.830
I said forget about me.

07:43.670 --> 07:46.420
I didn't say it for you.

07:52.380 --> 07:56.100
I don't have a past to boast about like you,

07:56.180 --> 07:59.560
but I came here because I don't want to give up soccer.

07:59.640 --> 08:02.560
I'm here to change my life!

08:03.150 --> 08:05.940
I don't know much about your past or your injury,

08:06.820 --> 08:09.280
but we are forwards!

08:09.360 --> 08:12.240
The pain, the regret, all of it,

08:12.320 --> 08:14.740
we can leave behind with a single goal!

08:21.000 --> 08:22.330
That's it!

08:23.460 --> 08:25.790
Who cares about the past?

08:25.880 --> 08:28.500
What I want to see is who you are now!

08:31.760 --> 08:36.140
We're not here to cry and give up, are we?

08:37.390 --> 08:40.810
"Set up the defense properly and stop them, you bunch of idiots!"

08:40.890 --> 08:42.600
says my bro.

08:42.680 --> 08:44.100
-Sorry!
-Okay.

08:44.190 --> 08:45.480
Come on, let's regroup!

08:47.270 --> 08:49.070
You ready, bro?

08:50.190 --> 08:52.820
As long as we play together, we can win easily.

08:52.900 --> 08:54.150
Hey bro.

08:54.240 --> 08:57.160
Don't do that, you're sulking right away!

08:57.240 --> 08:59.280
Bro! It came from the wing!

09:00.490 --> 09:02.000
The guy's distracted.

09:03.000 --> 09:04.000
I stole it.

09:04.830 --> 09:07.250
Told you, you idiot!

09:07.330 --> 09:08.790
Our target

09:09.590 --> 09:10.590
is Kuon-chan, right?

09:12.510 --> 09:14.880
If your weapon is jumping,

09:14.970 --> 09:16.010
I'm sure you can reach it.

09:22.220 --> 09:24.310
<i>Seriously? He's shooting from there?</i>

09:33.940 --> 09:34.860
That's it!

09:34.950 --> 09:38.410
Kuon, another one? The keeper couldn't even react!

09:38.490 --> 09:40.450
This is unfair, you're scoring all of them.

09:40.530 --> 09:43.290
I'm totally in the zone today!

09:44.200 --> 09:45.200
Kuon.

09:47.080 --> 09:49.210
"Don't get cocky, you lucky bastards!"

09:49.290 --> 09:50.960
Not like that, bro!

09:51.040 --> 09:52.500
You need to focus!

09:52.590 --> 09:53.710
Stay calm!

09:54.880 --> 09:55.920
Got it!

09:56.010 --> 09:58.640
Now it's our turn, the three of us.

09:58.720 --> 10:00.720
I can't just sit and watch Kuon!

10:00.800 --> 10:02.310
Let's all dive in.

10:09.060 --> 10:11.230
<i>Wanima Junichi committed a foul.</i>

10:11.320 --> 10:13.030
<i>Team Z will take a free kick.</i>

10:13.780 --> 10:15.110
Here's our chance.

10:15.650 --> 10:18.070
SET-PIECE TAKER: BACHIRA

10:18.700 --> 10:21.030
They're really badly aligned.

10:22.120 --> 10:23.830
Their weak spot is

10:24.450 --> 10:25.450
there!

10:33.250 --> 10:34.170
Kuon.

10:34.250 --> 10:35.380
That guy again!

10:36.420 --> 10:38.340
That's it, hat trick!

10:39.340 --> 10:42.100
HALF-TIME
FIRST HALF

10:44.100 --> 10:47.520
This kid hadn't really stood out until now,

10:47.600 --> 10:48.690
but isn't he great?

10:49.810 --> 10:52.900
Hell yeah! We're ahead 3-0 at half-time!

10:52.980 --> 10:56.360
Kuon's weapon is on fire! He's carrying the game by himself!

10:56.440 --> 11:00.000
-You rascal!
-I'm in terrifyingly good form today!

11:02.780 --> 11:04.280
Ketchup is flowing!

11:04.370 --> 11:07.790
I'll score a hat trick too and end the match 6-0!

11:07.870 --> 11:12.000
Coach Kuon's "Stars of the South Plan" is working perfectly.

11:12.080 --> 11:14.750
Now the name sounds cool!

11:14.840 --> 11:17.760
I thought it was cool from the start.

11:17.840 --> 11:19.260
Don't let your guard down!

11:19.340 --> 11:20.590
-Okay!
-Okay!

11:20.680 --> 11:24.470
<i>Thanks to Kuon, the whole team is applying pressure.</i>

11:24.550 --> 11:25.930
<i>We've gotten stronger.</i>

11:26.010 --> 11:27.640
Come on, kick the ball!

11:33.400 --> 11:34.520
Let's go, guys!

11:34.610 --> 11:35.770
-Alright!
-Alright!

11:37.480 --> 11:39.360
In a heated place like this,

11:40.450 --> 11:44.450
are you still playing just to give up,

11:45.370 --> 11:46.370
Chigiri?

11:55.590 --> 11:57.500
SECOND HALF BEGINS

12:00.470 --> 12:01.400
From this moment on,

12:01.420 --> 12:02.840
it's Raichi's time as center forward!

12:03.890 --> 12:07.810
Ah, so "big bro" came all alone to stop me?

12:10.730 --> 12:12.350
Raichi! Pass it back for now!

12:13.100 --> 12:14.560
Let's play for time!

12:16.480 --> 12:18.360
Pass the ball back, Kuon.

12:18.440 --> 12:20.610
Don't hog all the fun!

12:20.690 --> 12:21.610
Of course.

12:21.700 --> 12:23.450
Our priority is the team winning.

12:26.200 --> 12:27.870
I'll take the fun part.

12:27.950 --> 12:29.620
You lost the ball, you parasitic bastard!

12:30.200 --> 12:32.830
<i>Both of them are coming from midfield?</i>

12:33.540 --> 12:36.500
<i>Then I'll foul them again to stop them!</i>

12:37.130 --> 12:38.170
Chigiri!

12:44.800 --> 12:46.390
-I'll handle it!
-Hop.

12:48.510 --> 12:49.600
Damn it!

12:49.680 --> 12:53.100
<i>If we let those two run free, we're in trouble.</i>

12:58.520 --> 12:59.980
We're still two goals ahead.

13:00.070 --> 13:01.530
Stay calm.

13:01.610 --> 13:03.240
Let's play with passes.

13:03.320 --> 13:06.620
<i>He's right, we're ahead after all.</i>

13:07.530 --> 13:08.530
Isagi-kun.

13:09.700 --> 13:11.620
<i>What? He's passing it back to me?</i>

13:11.700 --> 13:13.160
<i>And it's way too far!</i>

13:14.960 --> 13:16.170
Sorry!

13:18.080 --> 13:22.050
<i>That carelessness was a fatal mistake!</i>

13:28.050 --> 13:30.300
What the hell do you think you're doing, Kuon?

13:30.320 --> 13:32.580
Did you lose focus after the hat trick?

13:32.610 --> 13:34.340
Calm down, Raichi! Don't start a fight!

13:35.190 --> 13:36.190
Sorry, I—

13:37.150 --> 13:38.650
What am I really doing?

13:39.900 --> 13:41.650
And in a game like this.

13:43.110 --> 13:44.150
Forgive me!

13:45.400 --> 13:49.490
Lift your head, Kuon. You didn't do it on purpose.

13:49.570 --> 13:50.570
Let's keep going.

13:51.580 --> 13:55.210
He apologized and that's it? We conceded 2 goals because of this bastard!

13:55.290 --> 13:58.460
We're still ahead. Let's think about how to stop them.

13:58.540 --> 13:59.380
Exactly.

13:59.460 --> 14:02.670
Should we keep attacking or pull back on defense?

14:02.750 --> 14:04.210
That's enough, get up.

14:05.840 --> 14:06.840
Sorry.

14:07.970 --> 14:09.050
<i>This is bad.</i>

14:09.140 --> 14:11.140
<i>If we can't stop their next attacks,</i>

14:11.720 --> 14:12.810
<i>at this rate...</i>

14:17.390 --> 14:18.730
<i>What?</i>

14:18.810 --> 14:20.020
<i>Did he just,</i>

14:20.900 --> 14:21.980
<i>smile?</i>

14:25.150 --> 14:26.780
<i>I must have seen wrong.</i>

14:28.610 --> 14:29.570
15TH MINUTE OF THE 2ND HALF

14:29.660 --> 14:31.710
If we score one more goal in the remaining 30 minutes...

14:32.030 --> 14:34.540
I think we should keep attacking!

14:34.620 --> 14:36.200
Yeah, let's push forward.

14:36.280 --> 14:38.780
That's the spirit, right Isagi?

14:38.870 --> 14:39.870
Exactly!

14:43.170 --> 14:47.840
<i>Anyway, if we score the next goal, the match is secured!</i>

14:47.920 --> 14:49.510
Bring it on!

14:49.590 --> 14:51.850
<i>Don't fall behind their pace!</i>

14:54.720 --> 14:56.930
<i>The formation we practiced,</i>

14:57.020 --> 15:01.100
<i>a triangle with Isagi in the middle, Bachira and me on the wings.</i>

15:01.690 --> 15:04.820
<i>If I can get into range, I won't show any mercy!</i>

15:04.900 --> 15:07.990
<i>Still too far. And there's no opening.</i>

15:08.070 --> 15:10.630
<i>If Bachira can break their defense with his dribbling...</i>

15:10.700 --> 15:12.700
Well, this is embarrassing.

15:12.780 --> 15:16.330
<i>They've cut off my path to Bachira! In that case,</i>

15:16.410 --> 15:17.410
Isagi!

15:17.910 --> 15:21.080
<i>Or do they know our plan?</i>

15:21.960 --> 15:23.290
Get out of my way!

15:24.590 --> 15:25.590
Damn it!

15:25.670 --> 15:26.500
<i>This is really strange.</i>

15:26.590 --> 15:28.420
<i>No matter how much they've practiced,</i>

15:28.510 --> 15:32.220
<i>there's no way they could grasp our playing style at first glance.</i>

15:33.260 --> 15:34.800
<i>Our weapons have been broken!</i>

15:35.600 --> 15:38.680
<i>I can't smell the goal!</i>

15:40.350 --> 15:41.390
Well done, bro!

15:41.480 --> 15:42.480
Shit!

15:43.810 --> 15:47.940
<i>There really is something off. Unless they knew our plan—</i>

15:50.280 --> 15:52.320
<i>No, no, that's impossible!</i>

15:52.410 --> 15:54.660
<i>If we lose, we're eliminated!</i>

15:54.740 --> 15:56.910
<i>What good would that do?</i>

15:56.990 --> 15:58.450
Hat trick!

15:58.540 --> 16:01.160
We conceded 2 goals because of this bastard!

16:02.370 --> 16:06.170
<i>Come to think of it, all the goals in this match...</i>

16:06.250 --> 16:07.330
Finish them off, bro!

16:08.880 --> 16:10.550
-Yours!
-Kuon! Got it!

16:12.720 --> 16:14.010
<i>Did he miss on purpose?</i>

16:20.640 --> 16:23.270
-Hell yeah!
-Get down!

16:27.820 --> 16:28.820
Kuon.

16:30.690 --> 16:32.860
Did you

16:33.860 --> 16:34.860
betray us?

16:42.910 --> 16:44.830
Bingo!

16:46.920 --> 16:50.090
They already figured it out, Kuon-chan.

16:51.340 --> 16:54.630
All your plans, your weapons, your weaknesses,

16:54.720 --> 16:57.390
he leaked them all to us!

16:57.470 --> 17:01.220
Last night, during the meeting, he came to us

17:01.310 --> 17:04.810
and told us about this betrayal plan, right?

17:07.520 --> 17:08.610
<i>That's when?</i>

17:11.070 --> 17:12.190
And so,

17:12.780 --> 17:14.780
we "gladly accept the game!"

17:14.860 --> 17:16.910
is what we're saying.

17:17.950 --> 17:20.290
You're joking, right Kuon?

17:23.910 --> 17:26.290
Seriously, man.

17:27.630 --> 17:29.250
Fuck off!

17:29.340 --> 17:30.340
I'll kill you!

17:30.420 --> 17:32.420
What were you thinking!

17:33.090 --> 17:37.890
I simply chose the most logical option to survive in Blue Lock.

17:41.600 --> 17:43.930
<i>Raichi Jingo, yellow card.</i>

17:44.020 --> 17:46.980
<i>Return to the field immediately and restart the match.</i>

17:49.690 --> 17:51.110
As if I can!

17:51.190 --> 17:52.940
Who can play in this situation!

17:53.030 --> 17:54.030
Hey.

17:54.690 --> 17:56.150
What's the meaning of this?

17:56.240 --> 17:58.820
This is just like "Selfish Sinbad."

17:58.910 --> 18:00.870
If we lose, we're eliminated!

18:00.950 --> 18:02.830
What good does deliberately losing do!

18:07.170 --> 18:08.750
You're the only fools here.

18:09.790 --> 18:12.300
The ones who will lose and go home are you.

18:13.210 --> 18:15.840
I'll survive on my own.

18:20.390 --> 18:21.930
Thanks, Kuon-chan.

18:22.010 --> 18:24.720
Did you just pass to them?

18:25.890 --> 18:29.810
From now on, it's 12 against 10.

18:33.900 --> 18:36.400
Is something like this allowed, Ego-san?

18:36.950 --> 18:38.610
Shut up and watch.

18:39.450 --> 18:40.870
What? Ego-san!

18:40.950 --> 18:44.040
What will you do now, Team Z?

18:47.790 --> 18:50.000
Kuon, why?

18:50.080 --> 18:54.500
In the previous match, when Isagi scored at the last second and we won,

18:54.590 --> 18:59.720
I thought our chances of winning the next matches with a team hanging by a thread

18:59.800 --> 19:02.930
were low.

19:03.640 --> 19:06.770
According to the standings, our final opponent

19:07.600 --> 19:11.440
<i>is Team V, the only team with two wins in the group.</i>

19:11.520 --> 19:15.940
<i>They beat Team Y 8-0, the team we barely beat.</i>

19:16.440 --> 19:18.030
<i>We have no chance of winning.</i>

19:18.610 --> 19:23.700
So I gave up on winning as a team and decided to save myself.

19:24.280 --> 19:25.240
Save yourself?

19:25.330 --> 19:27.370
Did you forget?

19:29.460 --> 19:33.420
The special rule of the first selection that Ego mentioned,

19:34.130 --> 19:37.170
'In the event your team does not finish in the top two,'

19:37.260 --> 19:42.180
'the top scorer of that team will advance.'

19:45.430 --> 19:48.020
So I made a deal.

19:48.100 --> 19:50.560
In exchange for leaking information to Team W

19:50.640 --> 19:52.940
and letting them win,

19:53.020 --> 19:56.320
<i>I asked them to let me score 3 goals.</i>

19:57.070 --> 20:01.280
<i>To become the team's top scorer and win.</i>

20:02.200 --> 20:03.200
You!

20:05.700 --> 20:08.330
What was everything up to now for?

20:08.410 --> 20:10.460
Didn't you say we would win together?

20:10.540 --> 20:12.370
Thanks, Isagi-kun.

20:15.000 --> 20:18.380
Your being this stupid worked out for me.

20:21.630 --> 20:25.260
You're too naive. This is Blue Lock.

20:25.350 --> 20:27.970
We don't need 'bonds' or 'team.'

20:28.060 --> 20:31.270
All you need is ego to win.

20:31.350 --> 20:34.770
Yes, 'Win, even if it means betrayal!'

20:35.690 --> 20:38.860
That is my ego!

20:47.370 --> 20:50.160
Good job, Team Z.

20:51.120 --> 20:54.920
<i>Damn it all!</i>

20:55.000 --> 20:57.210
<i>I won't let it end like this!</i>

22:30.010 --> 22:32.470
<i>Blue Lock, Extra Time.</i>

22:33.140 --> 22:38.140
Our breakfast is the best!

22:38.230 --> 22:40.520
A morning without bread is no morning!

22:40.610 --> 22:43.150
No, you can't have a morning without rice!

22:43.230 --> 22:46.320
Rice is the pride of Japan!

22:46.400 --> 22:50.570
No, bread has more variety.

22:50.660 --> 22:52.780
You can eat rice for lunch and dinner too!

22:52.870 --> 22:55.750
Mornings are for bread and nothing else, morons!

22:55.830 --> 23:00.290
Rice is the best breakfast. Bread doesn't even keep you full!

23:00.370 --> 23:02.130
Miso soup and rice!

23:02.210 --> 23:05.760
It's time to bring traditional Japanese food back!

23:05.840 --> 23:07.630
WATARU KUON

23:07.720 --> 23:09.380
That was a nice shower.

23:10.340 --> 23:12.800
Hey, Kuon! You eat bread in the morning, right?

23:12.890 --> 23:14.760
Rice, right? You are Japanese, after all!

23:14.850 --> 23:17.180
-Well...
-Which is it? Tell us already!

23:17.270 --> 23:18.890
Pick us!

23:18.980 --> 23:21.020
Well...

23:21.100 --> 23:26.110
I prefer cornflakes with milk.

23:26.190 --> 23:28.240
You traitor!

23:28.320 --> 23:30.280
We have a secret cornflake soldier among us!

23:30.360 --> 23:32.620
Join the rice cult!

23:32.700 --> 23:35.330
Curse Kuon with yeast!